{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は『劇場霊』観てきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼっちで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/02/6154984/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホラー映画を１人で観に行くって\nなかなかですよね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば\n『クロユリ団地』も１人で観に行ったっけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画が始まる前、辺りを見渡すと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップル..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップル..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじいちゃん！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじっこにおじいちゃん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじいちゃんの隣に座って\nやたら話しかければ\n遠目で観たら、\nカップルか何かには見えて\n寂しくないかもしれないけど\n席は決まってるのでやめました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホラー映画とか見れる人だけど\n怖かったよ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、蘭世とみり愛と一緒にいたとき\n外から変な音が聞こえた時\n表情変えないようにしてたけど\n普通にヒヤヒヤしてました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『Men's JOKER WATCH』\n本日発売です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/02/6154984/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/02/6154984/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールで\n『SJ WATCH』という特集に載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.i